{"2868100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shamania", "steam_appid": 2868100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more fun with friends! Explore, build, and battle together in an immersive shared world, sharing the adventure every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is the heart of your survival. Gather resources to construct and upgrade your home, expanding its functionality and customizing it to suit your needs and milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by mastering essential professions like Mining, Herbalism, and Fishing. Level up your skills to unlock powerful recipes and tools, shaping your survival strategy and enhancing your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Shamania is full of dangers. Face enemies and overcome challenges to secure valuable rewards and strengthen your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an extensive crafting system that evolves as you progress. Unlock recipes to create gear, tools, and items that empower you to face greater challenges and achieve your goals.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more fun with friends! Explore, build, and battle together in an immersive shared world, sharing the adventure every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is the heart of your survival. Gather resources to construct and upgrade your home, expanding its functionality and customizing it to suit your needs and milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by mastering essential professions like Mining, Herbalism, and Fishing. Level up your skills to unlock powerful recipes and tools, shaping your survival strategy and enhancing your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Shamania is full of dangers. Face enemies and overcome challenges to secure valuable rewards and strengthen your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.poster.avif?t=1780056234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.webm?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.mp4?t=1780056234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an extensive crafting system that evolves as you progress. Unlock recipes to create gear, tools, and items that empower you to face greater challenges and achieve your goals.</p>", "short_description": "Shamania is an open world survival game where you can CRAFT, FIGHT, and EXPLORE a vibrant sandbox world with friends in CO-OP. Expand your base as a hub for survival, gather resources, and master professions to unlock new tools and opportunities!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/4d7ca9fe47b488329b8cc197db6ad3d546c8a1d5/header.jpg?t=1780056234", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/63cc9b6f553ed58a768aa96a7527893dcd456e7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780056234", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/63cc9b6f553ed58a768aa96a7527893dcd456e7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780056234", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong